<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post4725272815344099381..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Captain Blackadder&#39;s Lament: Imperialism Isn&#39;t Fun When The Enemy Can Shoot Back</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><link rel='next' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default?start-index=26&amp;max-results=25'/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>28</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5258858789604804417</id><published>2014-01-31T19:50:29.481-07:00</published><updated>2014-01-31T19:50:29.481-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Oh sure imperialism is fun when everyone bows down...</title><content type='html'>Oh sure imperialism is fun when everyone bows down and sucks your dick. But when they can fight back fun&amp;#39;s over. Get ready for payback for all the abuse you did.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Seriously complacency and arrogance are the true killers of empires they think they are unbeatable but time and history has proven otherwise.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Poor captain Blackadder sadly that&amp;#39;s what you get when you support an imperial tyranny and somebody has the power to fight them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/5258858789604804417'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/5258858789604804417'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1391223029481#c5258858789604804417' title=''/><author><name>Francisco</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-467628743"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 31, 2014 at 7:50 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7605410355860087249</id><published>2011-07-07T17:18:46.749-06:00</published><updated>2011-07-07T17:18:46.749-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Brilliant and pointed, and well done in being brou...</title><content type='html'>Brilliant and pointed, and well done in being brought forward from four years ago, a period wherein &amp;quot;our&amp;quot; imperial pretensions have only increased.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;(You might want to remove the closing video clip, or note what it contained, as the BBC has had it taken down at YouTube.)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/7605410355860087249'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/7605410355860087249'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1310080726749#c7605410355860087249' title=''/><author><name>Greybird</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/08354419872076408284</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://img154.imageshack.us/img154/9729/leunggreybirdltdetailrdek6.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1392371442"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="July 7, 2011 at 5:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5132667914292400996</id><published>2009-10-28T21:46:51.985-06:00</published><updated>2009-10-28T21:46:51.985-06:00</updated><title type='text'>May I use your Latin Motto ? I love it&#xa;And Blackad...</title><content type='html'>May I use your Latin Motto ? I love it&lt;br /&gt;And Blackadder, one of the great philosophers, with classics like, &amp;quot; Thinking is so importnat &amp;quot; &amp;amp; &amp;quot; I&amp;#39;ve got an idea &amp;amp; its as hot as my pants&amp;quot;. Fourth series good, second series GREAT. Who can forget Bob ( short for Kate) or The turnip shaped like a thingy.&lt;br /&gt;Words to live by</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/5132667914292400996'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/5132667914292400996'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1256788011985#c5132667914292400996' title=''/><author><name>Baldrick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/04357660654958011163</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-440572457"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 28, 2009 at 9:46 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2195478783725562651</id><published>2007-12-27T13:05:00.001-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-27T13:05:00.001-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Gen. Funston played in later history as well; both...</title><content type='html'>Gen. Funston played in later history as well; both alive and dead.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;He was Black Jack Pershing&#39;s boss during BJ&#39;s Mexico expedition to get Poncho Via. Funston was stationed in San Antonio and commanded BJ from there.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Funston had already been picked to COMMAND IN EUROPE by Wilson, who was even then running on a &quot;he kept us out&quot; platform. Funston dropped dead of a heart attack.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When word got to DC, Major Douglas McArthur was dispatched to find the Sec of War and give him the news. He found the SEc. in a meeting with the President...who exclaimed upon hearing the news &quot;Who will command in Europe?&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;See Frank VanDiver&#39;s 2-vol bibography of Black Jack - vol 1 I forget the page.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Very good article&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Dave: Former Airborne/Ranger</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/2195478783725562651'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/2195478783725562651'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1198785900001#c2195478783725562651' title=''/><author><name>oldagg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00537644867964847424</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1299128419"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2007 at 1:05 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6089648128712307950</id><published>2007-12-27T13:04:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-27T13:04:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Funston was Black Jack Pershing&#39;s boss, commanding...</title><content type='html'>Funston was Black Jack Pershing&#39;s boss, commanding from San Antonio while BJ was hunting Poncho in Mexico in 1915/16.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;When Funston dropped dead of a heart attack - news went to DC where Major Douglas McArthur was dispatched to find Sec of War and tell him. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Douglas found the SEC. in meeting with the Prresident who exclaimed, upon hearing the news,&quot;Who Will Command in Europe?!&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;This was 2 years before he finally dragged us into it and while he was running for reeclection under the &quot;he kept us out of war&quot; abner.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;McArthur recommended Pershing.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;see Frank VanDiver&#39;s 2 vol. Life of Black Jack - vol 1 I forget the page.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Get historical work and great piece the Britsh hu,mor is WAY appropriate.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;oldagg/former airborner / ranger</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6089648128712307950'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6089648128712307950'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1198785840000#c6089648128712307950' title=''/><author><name>oldagg</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 27, 2007 at 1:04 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3749288968407288163</id><published>2007-12-21T10:05:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-21T10:05:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>In my 60&#39;s days, we called &quot;ironic payback&quot; BAD KA...</title><content type='html'>In my 60&#39;s days, we called &quot;ironic payback&quot; BAD KARMA. Having suffered proportionately for the punishment i&#39;ve inflicted,  i believe in Karma, good or bad. I can only fathom the hell we will pay for our collective imperial slaughtering, Hawaii, Philippines, et.al.  Time is unforgiving.  In an Instant, Karma could knock on the door. We should pay our retributions now, rather than the damned later.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/3749288968407288163'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/3749288968407288163'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1198256700000#c3749288968407288163' title=''/><author><name>bustedflat</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11737334415306317225</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-233757288"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 21, 2007 at 10:05 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2366393182751540123</id><published>2007-12-14T12:54:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-14T12:54:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Did anyone notice Hugh Laurie (AKA Dr House) stand...</title><content type='html'>Did anyone notice Hugh Laurie (AKA Dr House) standing to the right of Blackadder?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;-Dave</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/2366393182751540123'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/2366393182751540123'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197662040000#c2366393182751540123' title=''/><author><name>David</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14275147887190756032</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1025184489"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 14, 2007 at 12:54 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1533186983963615480</id><published>2007-12-13T03:40:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-13T03:40:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Well done.</title><content type='html'>Well done.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/1533186983963615480'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/1533186983963615480'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197542400000#c1533186983963615480' title=''/><author><name>Meg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/11023871171456340729</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='24' src='http://farm1.static.flickr.com/25/94356204_c51a0ea64a.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-716945699"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 13, 2007 at 3:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1998986036276399551</id><published>2007-12-12T20:38:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-12T20:38:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>er, English language, that is.</title><content type='html'>er, English language, that is.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/1998986036276399551'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/1998986036276399551'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197517080000#c1998986036276399551' title=''/><author><name>jk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 12, 2007 at 8:38 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6143775759386487234</id><published>2007-12-12T20:28:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-12T20:28:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Future generations will undoubtedly read similar w...</title><content type='html'>Future generations will undoubtedly read similar words.  The question is whether or not our progeny will have retained sufficient underatanding of the English to derive any meaning from them.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6143775759386487234'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6143775759386487234'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197516480000#c6143775759386487234' title=''/><author><name>jk</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 12, 2007 at 8:28 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4010598928055943370</id><published>2007-12-12T15:51:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-12T15:51:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Absolutely brilliant.  One of the best essays I ha...</title><content type='html'>Absolutely brilliant.  One of the best essays I have read in some time. Unfortunately, as mentioned in the article, I am afraid my grandchildren will probably read something very similar in the far future.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;cheers.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/4010598928055943370'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/4010598928055943370'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197499860000#c4010598928055943370' title=''/><author><name>richardM</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 12, 2007 at 3:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4912780156707712601</id><published>2007-12-12T10:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-12T10:07:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;Falsification of history has done more to impede ...</title><content type='html'>&quot;Falsification of history has done more to impede human development than any single thing known to mankind&quot; Jean Jacques Rousseau 1712-1778</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/4912780156707712601'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/4912780156707712601'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197479220000#c4912780156707712601' title=''/><author><name>robertsgt40</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 12, 2007 at 10:07 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2969164400469599025</id><published>2007-12-12T08:40:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-12T08:40:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The problem with this article is that it does noth...</title><content type='html'>The problem with this article is that it does nothing to support the American mantra of &quot;This is the greatest country in the world.  We are the good guys who constantly strive to give of our superior knowledge, materials and morals to an ungrateful and jealous world.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Anything which does not support this line of thought will make a large number of Americans very angry and cause them to hate the messenger and ignore the message.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Sheeple, indeed.  In spades.  Recent years have given me a greater level of sympathy for the Germans of the 1930&#39;s.  At least they never declared themselves lovers of freedom and democracy in the first place.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/2969164400469599025'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/2969164400469599025'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197474000000#c2969164400469599025' title=''/><author><name>Marmoset</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00643025182666707369</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1946782160"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 12, 2007 at 8:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4353499683340111790</id><published>2007-12-11T22:56:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-11T22:56:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Liz,The War Prayer should indeed be read from ever...</title><content type='html'>Liz,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;The War Prayer should indeed be read from every pulpit but therein lies the rub.  You have to have literate, sensible people speaking from the podium.  And on top of that you have to have a flock &quot;willing&quot; to listen instead of wanting their ears tickled as is so often the custom.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/4353499683340111790'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/4353499683340111790'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197438960000#c4353499683340111790' title=''/><author><name>MOT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://www.dailydiktat.com/biohazard.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 11, 2007 at 10:56 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7747571157593270722</id><published>2007-12-11T22:51:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-11T22:51:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Remember this.  &quot;I have a cunning plan!&quot;Blackadder...</title><content type='html'>Remember this.  &quot;I have a cunning plan!&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Blackadder was a hoot.  And while your at it... get rid of that dead butler.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/7747571157593270722'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/7747571157593270722'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197438660000#c7747571157593270722' title=''/><author><name>MOT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='29' src='http://www.dailydiktat.com/biohazard.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 11, 2007 at 10:51 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7268736028775559260</id><published>2007-12-11T11:55:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-11T11:55:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Scott,Clarence Carson&#39;s Basic American History ser...</title><content type='html'>Scott,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Clarence Carson&#39;s Basic American History series provides a good overview from a balanced perspective.  It is perhaps not detailed enough for someone with your background (I read it in highschool), and he doesn&#39;t get into everything (for instance the war in the Phillipines), but it is still excellent.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;David K</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/7268736028775559260'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/7268736028775559260'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197399300000#c7268736028775559260' title=''/><author><name>dauvitbalfour</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12543093128734164639</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-2135287646"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 11, 2007 at 11:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3136776526463242268</id><published>2007-12-10T18:01:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-10T18:01:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It has been well said that &quot;power corrupts and abs...</title><content type='html'>It has been well said that &quot;power corrupts and absolute power...&quot;  also I believe long ago it was said that democracy was &quot;predicated on an educated electorate&quot;  Those corrupted powerful have a vested interest in insuring that &quot;we the sheeple remain sufficiently disinformed and distracted with NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, and endless blither &quot;reality shoes&quot; and the like to be true &quot;numbskulls&quot;.  Sadly one can be safer and perhaps happier to be so.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/3136776526463242268'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/3136776526463242268'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197334860000#c3136776526463242268' title=''/><author><name>billydick</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 10, 2007 at 6:01 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-471927427996148419</id><published>2007-12-10T14:35:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-10T14:35:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Great article! I love the whole Blackadder series....</title><content type='html'>Great article! I love the whole Blackadder series.  I particularly liked the mention of Mark Twain in this article.  He wrote The War Prayer (which can be found here:&lt;BR/&gt;http://libertarianchristians.org/war_prayer.htm)&lt;BR/&gt;to express his outrage over our government&#39;s intervention in the Philippines, though it was considered too radical at the time and was not published until 1916.  He may have been an unbeliever, but it is my humble opinion that The War Prayer should be read aloud from the pulpit of every church, temple, synagogue, etc. in this country.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Liz</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/471927427996148419'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/471927427996148419'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197322500000#c471927427996148419' title=''/><author><name>LibertyLadyFL</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 10, 2007 at 2:35 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-617877205772125851</id><published>2007-12-10T13:07:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-10T13:07:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>It occurs to me that much of the general apathy of...</title><content type='html'>It occurs to me that much of the general apathy of Americans with regards to the true nature of our nation is the result of simple ignorance of our history. Simply put, the &quot;education&quot; we get in public schools is VERY selective. Even what is taught is heavily biased to make America look good. For the bulk of Americans, their education of historical matters pretty much ends with public schooling. Some might move on to things like the &quot;History&quot; channel and other pro-state outlets of official history.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;My own education has been the result of many hours reading sites like Mises.org, LewRockwell.com, and the MANY sites I have found as a result of those two. In the course of years of dedicated studying, I have been putting together much of our history in a piece meal fashion. The problem is, I doubt there are many people out there that will take the time and effort to do this.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;What I have not seen, even if it does exist, is a good overview of the history of our country that is NOT of the variety found in public schools. It would be nice to see something that outlines all the various forgotten wars and their backgrounds.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;People can only &quot;wake up&quot; to the Truth when it is presented in an easily digestible manner. Few people are going to read something like Mises&#39; &quot;Human Action&quot; or Rothbard&#39;s &quot;Man, Economy &amp; State&quot;. If we cannot get this information to them in a manner they will consume, then they will never wake up. All the preaching in the world, no matter how Truthful, will ever matter because it will lack the context to make sense.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I recall that prior to obtaining a law degree and studying Mises and Rothbard, much of what I was hearing from people made no sense to me and thus I rejected it, even though it was true. Now that I have the proper context to understand what was being said, I can see that it was true. So I guess what I am getting at is that there needs to be some serious work at putting out what is needed to develop the groundwork, foundation, and context for issues like you discuss here so that it will have a broader appeal.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;By the way, I regularly link over here from LRC and love the articles. Thanks.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/617877205772125851'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/617877205772125851'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197317220000#c617877205772125851' title=''/><author><name>Scott F</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 10, 2007 at 1:07 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6378889568998586490</id><published>2007-12-10T09:39:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-10T09:39:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Very insightful.  Articles like this -- and there ...</title><content type='html'>Very insightful.  Articles like this -- and there are many -- definitively prove that America, after the early 1800&#39;s, quickly devolved into the very type of &quot;evil&quot; empire it persistently claims to oppose.  Why don&#39;t voters see the reality of what we&#39;ve become as a nation and society?  This remains a mystery to me how we still think America equals godliness in light of the brutal atrocities committed by gangs of greedy men.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6378889568998586490'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6378889568998586490'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197304740000#c6378889568998586490' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 10, 2007 at 9:39 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6357126637424327552</id><published>2007-12-10T08:44:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-10T08:44:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>I wonder how many &quot;law enforcement&quot; agents will be...</title><content type='html'>I wonder how many &quot;law enforcement&quot; agents will be echoing Captain Blackadder&#39;s lament about their own &quot;profession&quot; once the citizenry awakens from its torpor, arms itself to a level of parity with that of the State&#39;s agents, and begins to defend what little remains of its rights and freedoms.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6357126637424327552'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/6357126637424327552'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html?showComment=1197301440000#c6357126637424327552' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/12/captain-blackadders-lament-imperialism.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4725272815344099381' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/4725272815344099381' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 10, 2007 at 8:44 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8945057967825580268</id><published>2007-12-10T07:49:00.000-07:00</published><updated>2007-12-10T07:49:00.000-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Well written Mr. Grigg. The Blackadder series has ...</title><content type='html'>Well written Mr. Grigg. The Blackadder series has always been a favorite of mine but the fourth was, IMO, the best with the best ending ever. Your combination of the Blackadder humor with U.S. atrocities was a bold stroke of genius not easily undertaken. I look forward to your next triumph.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/8945057967825580268'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/4725272815344099381/comments/default/8945057967825580268'/><link rel='alterna